.subckt memristorR1 plus minus params: Ron=100 Roff=10k Rini=5k
.param uv=10f D=10n k={uv*Ron/D**2} a={(Rini-Ron)/(Roff-Rini)}

* Native dynamic resistor (breaks the PSpice E-source feedback loop)
Rmem plus minus R={Roff + (Ron-Roff)/(1+a*exp(limit(-4*k*V(q), -80, 80)))}

* Physical integrator (Restored: Cint stabilizes the Newton-Raphson solver)
Gx 0 q value={I(Rmem)}
Cint q 0 1
Raux q 0 100Meg

.ends memristorR1